{"v":4,"desc":"「忍兔：胡蘿蔔大戰」是忍者兔子「忍兔」和忍者狐狸「赤狐」為了找回被惡黨鼴鼠「萌幕府將軍」奪走的許多胡蘿蔔之旅的橫向卷軸疾走動作遊戲。\n在遊戲裡雖然出現了強力且多樣的敵人們，使用許多陷阱來阻擋忍兔和赤狐，但為了擊退他們，獲得多樣的裝備後逐漸強化角色等，充分展現橫向卷軸動作遊戲的趣味。","publisher":"ARC SYSTEM WORKS","release":"2019-04-25","genres":["動作","射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人 · 網路 2 人","langs":["日文","英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.6GB / Switch 0.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b6cd19b102d965f9ba46dfbf83ef71d0129d9a906e19da2c28e37b74d6346576.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/950c7e37b6ad96b2efb9b766f8f72d66a2ccba5138fd5b5f5aeee65335f3e937.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ce96adc5fee5b1b66444b924c0225838b51c7d40eb8f29bc78afe2bcca988088.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d1bd74e57d3b211012edd6a8f7aad09b659ea916acf0fd5116d77ac19f6122af.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/59f09595bff98efe121951bda83e0f3aac4c1d540a1529170045acdd925b0470.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/87cdb9fdae75bf6f877338a7b619aa614b8db6aa18d26e29ae8803ae15fe5f92.jpg"],"titleId":"010042d00d916000","demo":["70030000006942"],"dlc":[]}